  /* Exploded view                                                       */
  /* ------------------------------------------------------------------ */
  // Each part group carries data-dx / data-dy: its offset in the exploded
  // state. Scrolling the figure up the viewport interpolates those offsets to
  // zero, so the robot assembles itself as you read past it.

